WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 9.6 · Financial Management
Financial controls, approvals and procurement

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Set up money checks before the first payment: they are far harder to add later.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Open a separate bank account for the initiative now.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Name a compensating check if you cannot separate duties.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Set quote thresholds and declare conflicts of interest.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You map one money flow and write your first procurement thresholds.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
